    <div class="question">Q:水晶怎么 消磁?
      <span class="icon-inline icon-pink">[Icon]</span>
    </div>
    <p class="plain-text">碎石消磁、海盐消磁、鼠尾草消磁、月光消磁<br>
    流水消磁</p>
  </div>

  <div class="qa-block">
    <div class="question">Q:不佩戴水晶的时候放哪里?
      <span class="icon-inline icon-mixed">[Icon]</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer-list">
      <p><span class="num-marker">1</span>可以放在装有消磁石的盒子里存放起来;</p>
      <p><span class="num-marker">2</span>可以放在水晶簇或水晶洞里面;</p>
      <p><span class="num-marker">3</span>可以放一个软布在木盒，然后将水晶放里面。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

